    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδείμαντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειμαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fearless, dauntless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.17
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦλθ᾽ ἀ. ποδί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					697
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτῆς ἀ.</span>
			<i>without fear for</i> myself, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				162
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					771
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>where no fear is</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Philops.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
